# 🔐 Security

Kickflip OS is a development project.

Users should not assume that an early development release provides the same level of security, testing, compatibility, or stability as a mature operating system.

Security improvements should remain an important part of future development.

If you discover a security vulnerability, avoid publicly posting sensitive exploit details before the issue can be addressed.

